# ==============================================================================
# UFIS Frontend - Production Environment (used by Vercel automatically)
# ==============================================================================
# This file is loaded when Vite builds for production (npm run build).
# Vercel also picks this up during deployment.
#
# IMPORTANT: Since vercel.json proxies /api/v1/* → EC2 backend,
# the frontend only needs to call relative path /api/v1 (no IP/domain needed).
# This avoids Mixed Content (HTTPS → HTTP) browser blocks entirely.
#
# If you change the backend URL, update vercel.json → destination field.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

VITE_API_BASE=/api/v1
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/v1
